<title>AUSTRALIA: Leighton says motorway deed signed.</title>
<headline>Leighton says motorway deed signed.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leighton Holdings Ltd said on Monday Airport Motorway Ltd, in which it is a partner, has signed the project deed for the Eastern Distributor motorway project with the New South Wales Roads and Traffic Authority.</p>
<p>Leighton subsidiary Leighton Contractors Pty Ltd is contracted to Airport Motorway to design and construct the A$550 million project.</p>
<p>Leighton, 44.9 percent owned by Hochtief AG, would also operate and maintain the motorway in the long-term.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
